# Passed to `wrangler dev --env-file` by e2e/serve.mjs. Naming an env file
# makes wrangler skip .dev.vars (and .env), so a developer's real keys
# (Stripe, Resend, Anthropic, Google, Cloudinary, PostHog) are never loaded
# into the Worker under test. Every runtime value the tests need is passed
# with --var. Keep this file empty of values.
